18:32.580 --> 18:38.760
They literally pushed the mouse tissue across the evolutionary boundary just by changing the accessibility constraint.

18:38.940 --> 18:43.120
They didn't inject human DNA, they just altered the geometry of what was allowed to happen.

18:43.200 --> 18:46.360
This is the ultimate triumph of constraint geometry in evolution.

18:46.360 --> 18:52.080
Evolution does not need to sit at a drafting table and invent a new blueprint to construct a human brain.

18:52.440 --> 18:57.540
