19:19.640 --> 19:24.700
For that leap, Flyxion turns to a 2026 paper by Gonzalez and colleagues,

19:25.020 --> 19:28.920
which shifts our focus from how the brain is built to how it actually computes.

19:29.300 --> 19:32.920
Traditionally, the field of neuroscience has been entirely obsessed with the connectome.

19:33.040 --> 19:33.580
The connectome.

19:33.900 --> 19:35.360
The ultimate biological blueprint.

19:35.980 --> 19:39.320
The idea that if a neuron A is physically wired to neuron B via synapse,

19:39.700 --> 19:44.020
