22:07.580 --> 22:09.380
Oh, wow. That would be chaotic.

22:09.540 --> 22:10.400
It would be a disaster.

22:10.880 --> 22:14.080
The CA1 region acts as a geometric contextual filter.

22:14.080 --> 22:20.920
By rotating the subspace 90 degrees, it ensures that information is transformed and selectively routed

22:20.920 --> 22:22.880
rather than just passively transmitted.

22:23.420 --> 22:27.580
And the researchers proved this is computationally essential by building a recurrent neural network,

22:27.820 --> 22:31.140
an AI model designed to simulate this exact biological circuit.

22:31.720 --> 22:36.360
As the AI learned to navigate a spatial task, its internal subspace is naturally rotated,

22:36.760 --> 22:38.980
perfectly mirroring the real biological brain.

22:38.980 --> 22:41.660
