23:07.300 --> 23:12.240
The brain's communication geometry is dynamically reconfigurable on the fly.

23:12.780 --> 23:17.980
The physical meat of the brain, the actual wiring of the synapses, does not change moment to moment.

23:18.560 --> 23:24.840
