It completely separates the highly plastic, volatile environment of the hippocampus from the stable archival storage of the neocortex.

23:39.680 --> 23:44.860
The constraint geometry of the mind rotates to route information exactly where it needs to go,

23:45.220 --> 23:50.400
building temporary walls and channels without ever needing to physically rewire a single synapse.

